### 1. Health Check API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health
Accept: application.json

### 2. Auth - Register New Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "System Administrator",
  "email": "admin@utc.edu.vn",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "roleId": 1
}

### 3. Auth - Login Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Auth - Refresh Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "refreshToken": "<your-jwt-token>"
}

### 5. Auth - Change Password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "oldPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 6. Auth - Forgot Password (Send Reset Token via Email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/forgot-password?email=admin@utc.edu.vn

### 7. Auth - Reset Password with Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "email": "admin@utc.edu.vn",
  "resetToken": "<uuid-reset-token>",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 8. Upload Image to Cloudinary (Form Data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/upload/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### 9. Category - Create Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "name": "Sữa & Chế Phẩm Sữa",
  "slug": "sua-che-pham-sua",
  "description": "Các loại sữa tươi, sữa chua, bơ, phô mai",
  "isActive": true
}

### 10. Category - Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Accept: application.json

### 11. Supplier - Create Supplier
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "name": "Công ty Cổ phần Sữa Việt Nam (Vinamilk)",
  "phone": "02854155555",
  "address": "Số 10 Tân Trào, P. Tân Phú, Quận 7, TP. HCM",
  "isActive": true
}

### 12. Supplier - Get All Suppliers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers
Accept: application.json

### 13. Product - Create Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "sku": "SP-VNM-1L-001",
  "name": "Sữa tươi tiệt trùng Vinamilk 100% Không đường 1L",
  "unit": "Hộp",
  "isWeighing": false,
  "price": 35000.00,
  "costPrice": 28000.00,
  "stockQuantity": 100.000,
  "origin": "Việt Nam",
  "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg",
  "isActive": true
}

### 14. Product - Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Accept: application.json

### 15. Product - Search Product by Name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/search?keyword=Vinamilk
Accept: application.json

### 16. Order - Create Sales Order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application.json

{
  "orderCode": "ORD-20260914-001",
  "channel": "STORE",
  "userId": 1,
  "cashierId": 1,
  "customerName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "customerPhone": "0912345678",
  "shippingAddress": "Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội",
  "totalAmount": 70000.00,
  "discountAmount": 0.00,
  "finalAmount": 70000.00,
  "paidAmount": 100000.00,
  "changeAmount": 30000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "paymentStatus": "PAID",
  "orderStatus": "COMPLETED",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "Sữa tươi tiệt trùng Vinamilk 100% Không đường 1L",
      "unit": "Hộp",
      "quantity": 2.000,
      "unitPrice": 35000.00
    }
  ]
}

### 17. Order - Get All Orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Accept: application.json

### 18. Payment - Create VNPAY Payment URL for Order #1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payment/vnpay/create-payment/1
Accept: application.json

### 19. Inventory - View Stock History of Product #1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory-transactions/product/1
Accept: application.json

### 20. Swagger UI Docs (Open in Browser)
# http://localhost:8080/api/swagger-ui.html
